      "id": "i-allocated-virtual-texture-bb850d",
      "name": "IAllocatedVirtualTexture",
      "category": "VirtualTexturing",
      "signature": "IAllocatedVirtualTexture(In Desc, In Block Width In Tiles, In Block Height In Tiles, In Width In Blocks, In Height In Blocks, In Desc, In Block Width In Tiles, In Block Height In Tiles, In Width In Blocks, In Height In Blocks, In Depth In Tiles, U, False, U Int 32, U, U, U, U, U)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "In Desc",
          "type": "FAllocatedVTDescription&"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Block Width In Tiles",
          "type": "UInt"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Block Height In Tiles",
          "type": "UInt"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Width In Blocks",
          "type": "UInt"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Height In Blocks",
          "type": "UInt"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Desc",
          "type": "uint32 InDepthInTiles ) : Description ("
        },
        {
          "name": "In Block Width In Tiles",
          "type": "BlockWidthInTiles ("
        },
        {
          "name": "In Block Height In Tiles",
          "type": "BlockHeightInTiles ("
        },
        {
          "name": "In Width In Blocks",
          "type": "WidthInBlocks ("
        },
        {
          "name": "In Height In Blocks",
          "type": "HeightInBlocks ("
        },
        {
          "name": "In Depth In Tiles",
          "type": "DepthInTiles ("
        },
        {
          "name": "U",
          "type": "FrameDeleted ( 0"
        },
        {
          "name": "False",
          "type": "bIsWaitingToMap ("
        },
        {
          "name": "U Int 32",
          "type": "PageTableFormat ( EVTPageTableFormat::"
        },
        {
          "name": "U",
          "type": "SpaceID ( ~ 0"
        },
        {
          "name": "U",
          "type": "MaxLevel ( 0"
        },
        {
          "name": "U",
          "type": "VirtualAddress ( ~ 0"
        },
        {
          "name": "U",
          "type": "VirtualPageX ( ~ 0"
        },
        {
          "name": "U",
          "type": "VirtualPageY ( ~ 0"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "This interface represents a chunk of VT data allocated and owned by the renderer module, backed by both a page table texture, and a physical texture cache for each layer.\nBoth page table and physical texture may be shared amongst many different allocated virtual textures.\nAny method that deals with physical texture requires an explicit LayerIndex parameter to identify the physical texture in question,\nmethods that don't have LayerIndex parameter refer to properties shared by all textures using the given page table\nThese are created with IRendererModule::AllocateVirtualTexture, and destroyed with IRendererModule::DestroyVirtualTexture\nThey must be allocated from render thread, but may be destroyed from any thread"
    },
